# Dedicated TypeSystemAda plugin (a TypeSystemClang subclass).
#
# Routes DW_LANG_Ada* compile units to a TypeSystemAda that reuses
# TypeSystemClang's machinery but gives Ada values a native identity:
# GetMinimumLanguage() reports eLanguageTypeAda95, so values flow through the
# AdaLanguage data formatters directly (no C/C++ bridge). It also renders GNAT's
# mangled names with Ada syntax (pkg__type -> Pkg.Type) for display. Foundation
# for Ada-native behavior the Clang type model cannot represent (variant active
# member, true array bounds, fixed-point, tagged dispatch).
